Subject: [PATCH 02/17] Mobile: Add tile view for the note list

Adds a Google-Keep-style tile grid (NoteTileList/NoteTile) as an
alternative to the note list, using the same selection, navigation and
to-do checkbox logic as NoteItem. Tiles show the note title, a plain-text
body preview, and the first linked image once its resource is ready.
Notes.tsx picks the layout based on the new notes.mobileLayout setting.

